// tools/fixture/v07-plain.mjs - plain words (COACH-CH7 CH7-09, coach_answers_chat_2026-10-13b.md: "all explanations should be
// elementary school reading comprehension"). Applied LAST, after v07-words and v07-select, by BOTH builds
// (tools/fixture/build-fixture.mjs and tools/compile/i18n.mjs), so model/*.json keeps deep-equalling the fixture.
//
// Words only. Every entry rewrites the VALUE of an existing key in plain English and plain neutral Latin American Spanish: short
// sentences, common words, one idea per sentence, jargon replaced or explained ("RIR" -> "reps left in the tank", "RPE 8" ->
// "effort 8 of 10", "MYO set" -> spelled out, "stairway" -> "the plan adds sets week by week", "back-off set" -> "lighter set",
// "plyometric" -> "jumps"). The meaning is the same: no number, rule or exercise changes, every placeholder is kept exactly
// (tests/v07-plain-words.test.mjs). Left alone on purpose: [LEGAL REVIEW] copy (release, release line, health warning, coach
// bypass, the health questions, disclaimers: verbatim, AGENTS.md §11.4, §13), the coach's own 'Basic Instruction' lines (his words
// from his sheets), his own warning sentence 'Make sure (that) you have a fitness professional to help you understand what this
// means' (COACH-R2 R2-ATH-08),
// exercise, sport and day names, and i18n keys. The engine reads keys only, so no plan changes (samples' JSON byte-identical).
// Grades before and after: reviews/plain-words-2026-10-13.md (tools/readability.mjs). Decision: engine/DECISIONS.md G-315.

